  "reasoning": "The defendant deliberately used a hammer to damage a loader and a diesel engine belonging to the sand mining operation, causing property loss valued at 32,601 yuan. This constitutes intentional destruction of another's property with a relatively large amount, matching the statutory offense of \"故意毁坏财物\". No other elements (e.g., theft, fraud, endangerment) are present.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]故意毁坏财物<eoa>"
